    <h2>Warm-up — Notice and Wonder: Floor Plan</h2>
    <p>A floor plan is a map of a room viewed from above. Notice the room outline, door, windows and closet. Think quietly, then share a notice and a question with a partner.</p>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 340 395" width="340" height="395" role="img" aria-label="L-shaped room: main width6 feet, full left height15 feet, lower-right extension4 feet wide and5 feet high. Door on upper left, closet at upper right, two windows on bottom and one on lower right. Closet dimensions are not supplied.">
