    <p>The outer room measurements are fixed. The closet and door/window symbols above are schematic; their footprints and clearances are not additional measured rectangles. Do not derive a closet area by measuring the illustration.</p>
    <h2>Activity 1 — Floor Plans</h2>
    <p>Consider this independent arrangement with the same features as the source example. Write one thing you like and one change you would make, with reasons. Co-create mathematical questions about the space, then compare your questions with a partner (MLR5).</p>
